docs/idea-summaries/images/05/pipeline-two-forms.svg
     1	<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 1300 560" width="1300" height="560" font-family="Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" role="img" aria-labelledby="t d">
     2	<title id="t">The Y-Balance score computed two ways</title>
     3	<desc id="d">Top: the StaBLE Y-Balance score computation as one function with inline thresholds; the optimizer gets only the score error. Bottom: harness S, the same computation from the same cached pose input as five typed stages that read thresholds from a named config, run two warning-only checks and write a per-stage trace that the optimizer reads. Task scores are identical.</desc>
     4	<defs><marker id="m64748b" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8.5" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="#64748b"/></marker></defs>
