docs/idea-summaries/images/05/single-edit-profile.svg
     1	<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" viewBox="0 0 1360 470" width="1360" height="470" font-family="Inter, -apple-system, BlinkMacSystemFont, 'Segoe UI', Helvetica, Arial, sans-serif" role="img" aria-labelledby="t d">
     2	<title id="t">The single-edit success profile</title>
     3	<desc id="d">A proposer LLM makes 30 independent one-step edits to the same parent variant, in three sessions of ten. Each edit is invalid, valid but not a success, or a success: valid, lowering selection error by at least 1 percent and passing the shrinkage guard. The rates and the mean gain form the profile. Outcomes shown are illustrative.</desc>
     4	<defs><marker id="m64748b" viewBox="0 0 10 10" refX="8.5" refY="5" markerWidth="7" markerHeight="7" orient="auto-start-reverse"><path d="M0,0 L10,5 L0,10 z" fill="#64748b"/></marker></defs>
