docs/idea-summaries/images/05/single-edit-profile.svg:2:<title id="t">The single-edit success profile</title>
docs/idea-summaries/images/05/single-edit-profile.svg:3:<desc id="d">A proposer LLM makes 30 independent one-step edits to the same parent variant, in three sessions of ten. Each edit is invalid, valid but not a success, or a success: valid, lowering selection error by at least 1 percent and passing the shrinkage guard. The rates and the mean gain form the profile. Outcomes shown are illustrative.</desc>
