docs/idea-summaries/images/05/pipeline-two-forms.svg:2:<title id="t">The Y-Balance score computed two ways</title>
docs/idea-summaries/images/05/pipeline-two-forms.svg:3:<desc id="d">Top: the StaBLE Y-Balance score computation as one function with inline thresholds; the optimizer gets only the score error. Bottom: harness S, the same computation from the same cached pose input as five typed stages that read thresholds from a named config, run two warning-only checks and write a per-stage trace that the optimizer reads. Task scores are identical.</desc>
