docs/idea-summaries/images/05/bpt-equivalence-gate.svg:2:<title id="t">Behavior-preserving transformations pass an equivalence gate</title>
docs/idea-summaries/images/05/bpt-equivalence-gate.svg:3:<desc id="d">A base harness is rewritten with one level of each of five structural factors, matched to a common token count, and admitted to the study only if differential testing finds identical task scores and identical tool calls on cached development and selection inputs and on fuzzed inputs.</desc>
